[27.481954, "i", "cat > audit_report.txt << 'EOF'\nFirewall Port Compliance Audit Report\n======================================\n\nDate: 2024-05-05\nAuditor: System Administrator\n\nFINDINGS:\n---------\nTwo unauthorized ports were found open in the current firewall rules:\n- Port 3306 (MySQL)\n- Port 6379 (Redis)\n\nPOLICY:\n-------\nAccording to policy.conf, only the following ports should be open:\n- Port 22 (SSH)\n- Port 80 (HTTP)\n- Port 443 (HTTPS)\n\nACTION TAKEN:\n-------------\nRemoved unauthorized port rules from current_rules.txt to match policy.\nThe firewall rules file now complies with the approved port policy.\n\nSTATUS: RESOLVED\nEOF\n"]
